@startuml
title Agent Security MCP Gateway Architecture
actor User
component "MCP Host" as Host
component "Identity and Session" as Identity
component "Discovery and Route Registry" as Registry
component "Canonical Action Normalizer" as Normalizer
component "Deterministic Policy Engine" as Policy
component "Human Approval" as Approval
component "Forwarding Coordinator" as Forwarder
component "Result Guard" as Result
database PostgreSQL
component "Coverage Monitor" as Coverage
component "Downstream MCP Server" as Server

User --> Host
Host --> Identity
Identity --> Registry
Registry --> Normalizer
Normalizer --> Policy
Policy --> Approval : Tier 3 or ambiguity
Policy --> Forwarder : allowed or constrained
Approval --> Forwarder : exact single-use authorization
Forwarder --> Server : one revalidated call
Server --> Result : untrusted response
Result --> Host : governed data-only result
Policy --> PostgreSQL
Approval --> PostgreSQL
Forwarder --> PostgreSQL
Result --> PostgreSQL
Coverage --> Policy
Coverage --> PostgreSQL
@enduml
